    "%@ has not been trained this week. Meta-analyses show a graded dose-response between weekly sets per muscle and growth; Coach's starting range is ~%@–%@ sets/week for your experience. This may be intentional (a rest week or a focused block), but if it isn't, add 1–2 sets and adjust by feel and performance." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@ wurde diese Woche nicht trainiert. Metaanalysen zeigen eine abgestufte Dosis-Wirkungs-Beziehung zwischen Wochensätzen pro Muskel und Wachstum; der Startbereich des Coaches liegt bei ~%@–%@ Sätzen/Woche für deine Erfahrung. Das kann Absicht sein (Ruhewoche oder Schwerpunktblock), aber falls nicht, füge 1–2 Sätze hinzu und passe nach Gefühl und Leistung an."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ has not been trained this week. Meta-analyses show a graded dose-response between weekly sets per muscle and growth; Coach's starting range is ~%2$@–%3$@ sets/week for your experience. This may be intentional (a rest week or a focused block), but if it isn't, add 1–2 sets and adjust by feel and performance."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@ has not been trained this week. Meta-analyses show a graded dose-response between weekly sets per muscle and growth; Coach's starting range is ~%@–%@ sets/week for your experience. This may be intentional (a rest week or a focused block), but if it isn't, add 1–2 sets and adjust by feel and performance."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@ no se ha entrenado esta semana. Los metaanálisis muestran una relación dosis-respuesta gradual entre las series semanales por músculo y el crecimiento; el rango inicial del Coach es de ~%@–%@ series/semana para tu experiencia. Puede ser intencionado (semana de descanso o bloque específico), pero si no lo es, añade 1–2 series y ajusta según sensaciones y rendimiento."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@ n’a pas été travaillé cette semaine. Les méta-analyses montrent une relation dose-réponse graduelle entre séries hebdomadaires par muscle et croissance ; la fourchette de départ du Coach est de ~%@–%@ séries/semaine pour votre expérience. C’est peut-être voulu (semaine de repos ou bloc ciblé), sinon ajoutez 1 à 2 séries et ajustez selon les sensations et la performance."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@ is deze week niet getraind. Meta-analyses tonen een geleidelijke dosis-respons tussen wekelijkse sets per spier en groei; het startbereik van de coach is ~%@–%@ sets/week voor jouw ervaring. Dit kan bewust zijn (rustweek of gericht blok), maar zo niet, voeg dan 1–2 sets toe en stuur bij op gevoel en prestatie."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@ não foi treinado nesta semana. Meta-análises mostram uma relação dose-resposta gradual entre séries semanais por músculo e crescimento; a faixa inicial do Coach é de ~%@–%@ séries/semana para sua experiência. Pode ser proposital (semana de descanso ou bloco focado), mas se não for, adicione 1–2 séries e ajuste pela sensação e pelo desempenho."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@ 本周尚未训练。荟萃分析显示，每块肌肉每周组数与增长呈渐进的剂量-反应关系；按你的经验，教练的起始范围约为每周 %@–%@ 组。这可能是有意为之（休息周或专项阶段），如果不是，请增加 1–2 组，并根据感觉和表现调整。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@ 本週尚未訓練。統合分析顯示，每塊肌肉每週組數與增長呈漸進的劑量-反應關係；依你的經驗，教練的起始範圍約為每週 %@–%@ 組。這可能是刻意為之（休息週或專項階段），如果不是，請增加 1–2 組，並依感覺和表現調整。"
          }
        }
      },
      "comment" : "UI text shown in: Insight Rule (CadenceCore/Sources/CadenceCore/InsightRule.swift)"
    },
