      "comment" : "UI text shown in: Plan Execution Boundary (CadenceCore/Sources/CadenceCore/PlanExecutionBoundary.swift)"
    },
    "Intense sessions like HIIT and boxing count as real training load, so the coach won't push more easy cardio on top of them. Anything you still choose to do is yours to call — just weigh that recovery, not more work, is what turns today's load into fitness." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Intensive Einheiten wie HIIT und Boxen zählen als echte Trainingsbelastung, daher legt der Coach kein zusätzliches lockeres Cardio obendrauf. Was du trotzdem machst, entscheidest du – bedenke nur, dass Erholung, nicht mehr Arbeit, die heutige Belastung in Fitness verwandelt."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Intense sessions like HIIT and boxing count as real training load, so the coach won't push more easy cardio on top of them. Anything you still choose to do is yours to call — just weigh that recovery, not more work, is what turns today's load into fitness."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Las sesiones intensas como el HIIT y el boxeo cuentan como carga real, así que el Coach no añadirá más cardio suave encima. Lo que quieras hacer aun así es decisión tuya; solo ten en cuenta que es la recuperación, no más trabajo, lo que convierte la carga de hoy en forma física."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Les séances intenses comme le HIIT et la boxe comptent comme une vraie charge d’entraînement : le Coach n’ajoutera donc pas de cardio léger par-dessus. Ce que vous faites quand même vous appartient – gardez simplement en tête que c’est la récupération, et non plus de travail, qui transforme la charge du jour en forme."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Intensieve sessies zoals HIIT en boksen tellen als echte trainingsbelasting, dus de coach duwt er geen extra rustige cardio bovenop. Wat je toch nog doet, is jouw keuze – bedenk alleen dat herstel, en niet meer werk, de belasting van vandaag omzet in conditie."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Sessões intensas como HIIT e boxe contam como carga real de treino, então o Coach não vai empurrar mais cardio leve por cima. O que você ainda quiser fazer é decisão sua — só lembre que é a recuperação, e não mais trabalho, que transforma a carga de hoje em condicionamento."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "HIIT 和拳击等高强度训练算作真正的训练负荷，因此教练不会再额外安排轻松有氧。你仍想做什么由你决定——只需记住，把今天的负荷转化为体能的是恢复，而不是更多训练。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "HIIT 和拳擊等高強度訓練算作真正的訓練負荷，因此教練不會再額外安排輕鬆有氧。你仍想做什麼由你決定——只要記得，把今天的負荷轉化為體能的是恢復，而不是更多訓練。"
          }
        }
      },
      "comment" : "UI text shown in: Same Day Load Insight (CadenceCore/Sources/CadenceCore/SameDayLoadInsight.swift)"
    },
