    "Meta-analyses show a graded dose-response between weekly sets per muscle and growth, but the exact useful dose varies by person. %@ is below Coach's starting range (~%@–%@ sets/week); add a set or two and judge by performance and recovery." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Metaanalysen zeigen eine abgestufte Dosis-Wirkungs-Beziehung zwischen Wochensätzen pro Muskel und Wachstum, aber die sinnvolle Dosis ist individuell. %@ liegt unter dem Startbereich des Coaches (~%@–%@ Sätze/Woche); füge ein oder zwei Sätze hinzu und richte dich nach Leistung und Erholung."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Meta-analyses show a graded dose-response between weekly sets per muscle and growth, but the exact useful dose varies by person. %1$@ is below Coach's starting range (~%2$@–%3$@ sets/week); add a set or two and judge by performance and recovery."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Meta-analyses show a graded dose-response between weekly sets per muscle and growth, but the exact useful dose varies by person. %@ is below Coach's starting range (~%@–%@ sets/week); add a set or two and judge by performance and recovery."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Los metaanálisis muestran una relación dosis-respuesta gradual entre las series semanales por músculo y el crecimiento, pero la dosis útil varía según la persona. %@ está por debajo del rango inicial del Coach (~%@–%@ series/semana); añade una o dos series y juzga por rendimiento y recuperación."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Les méta-analyses montrent une relation dose-réponse graduelle entre séries hebdomadaires par muscle et croissance, mais la dose utile varie selon les personnes. %@ est sous la fourchette de départ du Coach (~%@–%@ séries/semaine) ; ajoutez une ou deux séries et jugez selon la performance et la récupération."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Meta-analyses tonen een geleidelijke dosis-respons tussen wekelijkse sets per spier en groei, maar de nuttige dosis verschilt per persoon. %@ ligt onder het startbereik van de coach (~%@–%@ sets/week); voeg een set of twee toe en oordeel op prestatie en herstel."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Meta-análises mostram uma relação dose-resposta gradual entre séries semanais por músculo e crescimento, mas a dose útil varia de pessoa para pessoa. %@ está abaixo da faixa inicial do Coach (~%@–%@ séries/semana); adicione uma ou duas séries e avalie pelo desempenho e pela recuperação."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "荟萃分析显示，每块肌肉每周组数与增长呈渐进的剂量-反应关系，但有效剂量因人而异。%@ 低于教练的起始范围（约 %@–%@ 组/周）；增加一两组，并根据表现和恢复情况判断。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
