    "New here? Try alternating full-body sessions: Session A (squat, push, pull, carry) and Session B (hinge, press, pull, core). 2–3 sets per movement, %lld–%lld reps, leaving ~%lld in reserve." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Neu hier? Probiere abwechselnde Ganzkörpereinheiten: Einheit A (Kniebeuge, Drücken, Ziehen, Tragen) und Einheit B (Hüftbeugen, Pressen, Ziehen, Rumpf). 2–3 Sätze pro Bewegung, %lld–%lld Wiederholungen, mit etwa %lld in Reserve."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "New here? Try alternating full-body sessions: Session A (squat, push, pull, carry) and Session B (hinge, press, pull, core). 2–3 sets per movement, %1$lld–%2$lld reps, leaving ~%3$lld in reserve."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "New here? Try alternating full-body sessions: Session A (squat, push, pull, carry) and Session B (hinge, press, pull, core). 2–3 sets per movement, %lld–%lld reps, leaving ~%lld in reserve."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "¿Eres nuevo? Prueba a alternar sesiones de cuerpo completo: sesión A (sentadilla, empuje, tirón, transporte) y sesión B (bisagra, press, tirón, core). 2–3 series por movimiento, %lld–%lld repeticiones, dejando unas %lld en reserva."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Nouveau ? Essayez d’alterner des séances corps entier : séance A (squat, poussée, tirage, porté) et séance B (charnière, développé, tirage, gainage). 2–3 séries par mouvement, %lld–%lld répétitions, en gardant environ %lld en réserve."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Nieuw hier? Probeer afwisselende fullbodysessies: sessie A (squat, duwen, trekken, dragen) en sessie B (heupscharnier, drukken, trekken, core). 2–3 sets per beweging, %lld–%lld herhalingen, met ongeveer %lld in reserve."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "É novo por aqui? Experimente alternar sessões de corpo inteiro: sessão A (agachamento, empurrar, puxar, carregar) e sessão B (dobradiça, desenvolvimento, puxar, core). 2–3 séries por movimento, %lld–%lld repetições, deixando cerca de %lld na reserva."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "刚开始？试试交替进行全身训练：A 训练（深蹲、推、拉、负重行走）和 B 训练（髋铰链、推举、拉、核心）。每个动作 2–3 组，%lld–%lld 次，保留约 %lld 次余力。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "剛開始？試試交替進行全身訓練：A 訓練（深蹲、推、拉、負重行走）和 B 訓練（髖鉸鏈、推舉、拉、核心）。每個動作 2–3 組，%lld–%lld 下，保留約 %lld 下餘力。"
          }
        }
      },
