    "Progressive overload drives strength and size: within a rep range, add reps to the top of the range first, then add load and reset — autoregulated by reps in reserve (RIR). Your %@ range is %lld–%lld reps at about %lld RIR." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Progressive Überlastung fördert Kraft und Muskelaufbau: Erhöhe innerhalb eines Wiederholungsbereichs zuerst die Wiederholungen bis zum oberen Ende, dann die Last und beginne von vorn – gesteuert über Wiederholungen in Reserve (RIR). Dein %@-Bereich liegt bei %lld–%lld Wiederholungen mit etwa %lld RIR."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Progressive overload drives strength and size: within a rep range, add reps to the top of the range first, then add load and reset — autoregulated by reps in reserve (RIR). Your %1$@ range is %2$lld–%3$lld reps at about %4$lld RIR."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Progressive overload drives strength and size: within a rep range, add reps to the top of the range first, then add load and reset — autoregulated by reps in reserve (RIR). Your %@ range is %lld–%lld reps at about %lld RIR."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "La sobrecarga progresiva impulsa la fuerza y el tamaño: dentro de un rango, primero sube las repeticiones hasta el máximo, luego añade carga y reinicia, autorregulado por las repeticiones en reserva (RIR). Tu rango de %@ es de %lld–%lld repeticiones con unas %lld RIR."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "La surcharge progressive développe force et volume : dans une plage de répétitions, ajoutez d’abord des répétitions jusqu’au haut de la plage, puis augmentez la charge et repartez – autorégulé par les répétitions en réserve (RIR). Votre plage %@ est de %lld à %lld répétitions à environ %lld RIR."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Progressieve overbelasting zorgt voor kracht en spiermassa: binnen een herhalingsbereik voeg je eerst herhalingen toe tot de bovenkant, daarna gewicht en begin je opnieuw – zelf geregeld via herhalingen in reserve (RIR). Je %@-bereik is %lld–%lld herhalingen met ongeveer %lld RIR."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "A sobrecarga progressiva gera força e hipertrofia: dentro de uma faixa, primeiro aumente as repetições até o topo, depois aumente a carga e recomece — autorregulado pelas repetições na reserva (RIR). Sua faixa de %@ é de %lld–%lld repetições com cerca de %lld RIR."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "渐进超负荷推动力量和肌肉增长：在一个次数区间内，先把次数加到区间上限，再增加负荷并重新开始——依据保留次数（RIR）自我调节。你的%@区间为 %lld–%lld 次，约保留 %lld 次。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "漸進超負荷推動力量和肌肉增長：在一個次數區間內，先把次數加到區間上限，再增加負荷並重新開始——依據保留次數（RIR）自我調節。你的%@區間為 %lld–%lld 下，約保留 %lld 下。"
          }
        }
      },
      "comment" : "UI text shown in: Recommendation Rule (CadenceCore/Sources/CadenceCore/RecommendationRule.swift)"
    },
