    "Re-testing the same standardized protocol is how you separate real progress from day-to-day noise. Your %@ is up %@ versus baseline — beyond the margin we'd write off as measurement error — so the training is working. Keep the block going, then re-test." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Wer dasselbe standardisierte Protokoll wiederholt, trennt echten Fortschritt vom Tagesrauschen. Dein %@ liegt %@ über dem Ausgangswert – mehr als die Messungenauigkeit –, das Training wirkt also. Führe den Block weiter und teste dann erneut."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Re-testing the same standardized protocol is how you separate real progress from day-to-day noise. Your %1$@ is up %2$@ versus baseline — beyond the margin we'd write off as measurement error — so the training is working. Keep the block going, then re-test."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Re-testing the same standardised protocol is how you separate real progress from day-to-day noise. Your %@ is up %@ versus baseline — beyond the margin we'd write off as measurement error — so the training is working. Keep the block going, then re-test."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Repetir el mismo protocolo estandarizado es lo que separa el progreso real del ruido del día a día. Tu %@ ha subido %@ respecto a la referencia, más allá del margen que atribuiríamos al error de medición, así que el entrenamiento funciona. Sigue con el bloque y luego vuelve a evaluarte."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Refaire le même protocole standardisé permet de distinguer un vrai progrès des variations quotidiennes. Votre %@ a progressé de %@ par rapport à la référence – au-delà de la marge d’erreur de mesure – donc l’entraînement fonctionne. Poursuivez le bloc, puis refaites le test."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Door hetzelfde gestandaardiseerde protocol te herhalen, scheid je echte vooruitgang van dagelijkse ruis. Je %@ is %@ gestegen ten opzichte van de nulmeting – meer dan wat we aan meetfout toeschrijven – dus de training werkt. Ga door met het blok en test daarna opnieuw."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Refazer o mesmo protocolo padronizado é o que separa o progresso real do ruído do dia a dia. Seu %@ subiu %@ em relação à referência — além da margem que atribuiríamos a erro de medição —, então o treino está funcionando. Continue o bloco e depois refaça o teste."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "重复同一标准化测试方案，才能把真实进步与日常波动区分开。你的%@比基线提高了 %@，超出了测量误差范围，说明训练有效。继续这个阶段，然后再复测。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "重複同一標準化測驗方案，才能把真實進步與日常波動區分開。你的%@比基準提高了 %@，超出了測量誤差範圍，代表訓練有效。繼續這個階段，然後再複測。"
          }
        }
      },
      "comment" : "UI text shown in: Insight Rule (CadenceCore/Sources/CadenceCore/InsightRule.swift)"
    },
