    "Run a 4–8 week block: higher-rep local-endurance work (%lld–%lld reps) plus easy aerobic support." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Absolviere einen 4–8-wöchigen Block: Kraftausdauer mit höheren Wiederholungen (%lld–%lld) plus lockere Ausdauerunterstützung."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Run a 4–8 week block: higher-rep local-endurance work (%1$lld–%2$lld reps) plus easy aerobic support."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Run a 4–8 week block: higher-rep local-endurance work (%lld–%lld reps) plus easy aerobic support."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Haz un bloque de 4–8 semanas: trabajo de resistencia local con repeticiones altas (%lld–%lld) más apoyo aeróbico suave."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Faites un bloc de 4 à 8 semaines : endurance musculaire à répétitions élevées (%lld–%lld) plus un soutien aérobie léger."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Doe een blok van 4–8 weken: lokaal uithoudingswerk met hogere herhalingen (%lld–%lld) plus lichte duurtraining als ondersteuning."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Faça um bloco de 4–8 semanas: resistência muscular com repetições altas (%lld–%lld) mais apoio aeróbico leve."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "进行 4–8 周的阶段：高次数局部耐力训练（%lld–%lld 次）加轻松有氧辅助。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "進行 4–8 週的階段：高次數局部耐力訓練（%lld–%lld 下）加輕鬆有氧輔助。"
          }
        }
      },
      "comment" : "UI text shown in: Coach Rule Support (CadenceCore/Sources/CadenceCore/CoachRuleSupport.swift)"
    },
    "Run a 4–8 week hypertrophy block: progress weekly sets at %lld–%lld reps, ~%lld RIR, then deload before pushing volume again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Absolviere einen 4–8-wöchigen Hypertrophieblock: steigere die Wochensätze bei %lld–%lld Wiederholungen, ~%lld RIR, und lege dann einen Deload ein, bevor du das Volumen weiter erhöhst."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Run a 4–8 week hypertrophy block: progress weekly sets at %1$lld–%2$lld reps, ~%3$lld RIR, then deload before pushing volume again."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Run a 4–8 week hypertrophy block: progress weekly sets at %lld–%lld reps, ~%lld RIR, then deload before pushing volume again."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Haz un bloque de hipertrofia de 4–8 semanas: aumenta las series semanales con %lld–%lld repeticiones, ~%lld RIR, y luego haz una descarga antes de volver a subir el volumen."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Faites un bloc d’hypertrophie de 4 à 8 semaines : augmentez les séries hebdomadaires à %lld–%lld répétitions, ~%lld RIR, puis faites une décharge avant d’augmenter à nouveau le volume."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Doe een hypertrofieblok van 4–8 weken: verhoog wekelijkse sets bij %lld–%lld herhalingen, ~%lld RIR, en neem daarna een deload voordat je het volume weer opvoert."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Faça um bloco de hipertrofia de 4–8 semanas: aumente as séries semanais com %lld–%lld repetições, ~%lld RIR, e depois faça um deload antes de subir o volume de novo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "进行 4–8 周增肌阶段：以 %lld–%lld 次、约 %lld RIR 逐周增加组数，然后先减量再继续加量。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "進行 4–8 週增肌階段：以 %lld–%lld 下、約 %lld RIR 逐週增加組數，然後先減量再繼續加量。"
          }
        }
      },
      "comment" : "UI text shown in: Coach Rule Support (CadenceCore/Sources/CadenceCore/CoachRuleSupport.swift)"
    },
    "Run a 4–8 week strength block: heavy main lifts at %lld–%lld reps, ~%lld RIR, with lower-volume accessories. Add load week to week, then take a lighter week." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Absolviere einen 4–8-wöchigen Kraftblock: schwere Hauptübungen mit %lld–%lld Wiederholungen, ~%lld RIR, dazu Zusatzübungen mit weniger Volumen. Steigere die Last von Woche zu Woche und lege dann eine leichtere Woche ein."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Run a 4–8 week strength block: heavy main lifts at %1$lld–%2$lld reps, ~%3$lld RIR, with lower-volume accessories. Add load week to week, then take a lighter week."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Run a 4–8 week strength block: heavy main lifts at %lld–%lld reps, ~%lld RIR, with lower-volume accessories. Add load week to week, then take a lighter week."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Haz un bloque de fuerza de 4–8 semanas: levantamientos principales pesados con %lld–%lld repeticiones, ~%lld RIR, y accesorios con menos volumen. Sube la carga semana a semana y luego haz una semana más ligera."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Faites un bloc de force de 4 à 8 semaines : mouvements principaux lourds à %lld–%lld répétitions, ~%lld RIR, avec des accessoires à faible volume. Augmentez la charge chaque semaine, puis prenez une semaine plus légère."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Doe een krachtblok van 4–8 weken: zware hoofdlifts bij %lld–%lld herhalingen, ~%lld RIR, met hulpoefeningen op lager volume. Verhoog het gewicht week na week en neem daarna een lichtere week."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Faça um bloco de força de 4–8 semanas: levantamentos principais pesados com %lld–%lld repetições, ~%lld RIR, e acessórios com menos volume. Aumente a carga semana a semana e depois faça uma semana mais leve."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "进行 4–8 周力量阶段：主项大重量 %lld–%lld 次、约 %lld RIR，辅助动作减少训练量。逐周增加负荷，然后安排一周轻松训练。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "進行 4–8 週力量階段：主項大重量 %lld–%lld 下、約 %lld RIR，輔助動作減少訓練量。逐週增加負荷，然後安排一週輕鬆訓練。"
          }
        }
      },
      "comment" : "UI text shown in: Coach Rule Support (CadenceCore/Sources/CadenceCore/CoachRuleSupport.swift)"
    },
    "Run a Cooper 12-minute run (or 1.5-mile run / Rockport walk) so Coach can track VO₂max and tailor cardio." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
